+/*
+ * 0159: ADMA2 read path (port of lavender-ios16 0233). The 0149/0150 attempts
+ * used 12-byte descriptors with a 32-bit select and never cleaned the
+ * descriptor table or bounce buffer to PoC, so the controller read stale
+ * descriptors and stalled. Here: 8-byte descriptors, HOST_CONTROL DMA select
+ * 0x10 (ADMA2 32-bit), explicit dcache clean before and after the transfer,
+ * a PIO-vs-DMA self-test, and PIO fallback on any error. Reads only.
